{
//该翻译补丁经检查没有任何问题。
  "$schema": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xen-42/outer-wilds-new-horizons/main/NewHorizons/Schemas/translation_schema.json",
  "UIDictionary": {
    "DreamSignal": "梦境信号",
    "Canyon Signal": "峡谷信号",
    "Woodlands Signal": "林地信号",
    "Diving Bell": "沉没的构筑物",
    "\"Enlightenment\"": "“启迪”",
    "\"Foresight\"": "“远见”",
    "\"Eternity\"": "“永恒”",
    "TransportPilgrimQM": "朝圣者运输船QM",
    "TransportPilgrimEYE": "朝圣者运输船EYE"
  },
  "DialogueDictionary": {
    // Slate（斯雷特）
    "Why do you keep saying random things before I launch?": "你为什么总在我发射前说些莫名其妙的话？",
    "Huh? Is that <![CDATA[<i>]]>shade<![CDATA[</i>]]> you're throwing at me? Because if that is shade I'll have you know that the fuel in those tanks <![CDATA[<i>]]>does<![CDATA[</i>]]> eventually run out, and I'm the one who refuels them, so keep that in mind.": "哈？你这是在给我<![CDATA[<i>]]>摆脸色<![CDATA[</i>]]>吗？要是这样的话，我得让你知道，那些油箱里的燃料<![CDATA[<i>]]>终究<![CDATA[</i>]]>会耗尽，而给它们加油的人是我，这点你可得记住。",
    "Huh? Is that <![CDATA[<i>]]>shade<![CDATA[</i>]]> you're throwing at me? Because if that is shade I'll have you know that the fuel in those tanks <![CDATA[<i>]]>does<![CDATA[</i>]]> eventually run out, and I'm the one who refuels them, so you better be nice to me.": "哈？你这是在给我<![CDATA[<i>]]>摆脸色<![CDATA[</i>]]>吗？要是这样的话，我得让你知道，那些油箱里的燃料<![CDATA[<i>]]>终究<![CDATA[</i>]]>会耗尽，而给它们加油的人是我，所以你最好对我好点。",
    "Not sure what you mean though. If by \"random things\" you mean \"giving pilots actually good advice before their first launch\", I guess I do it out of the goodness of my heart, you know?": "不过我不太明白你的意思。要是你说的“莫名其妙的话”是指“在飞船驾驶员第一次发射前给他们真正有用的建议”，那我想我是出于好心才这么做的，懂吗？",
    "Not really sure what you mean though. I mean, I guess I occasionally think to tell the travelers stuff that they'd find useful, especially when it's their first go at it. If that's what you mean by \"random\" then I have no idea what to tell you.": "不过我真的不太明白你的意思。我是说，我偶尔会想着告诉探险者们一些他们可能觉得有用的东西，尤其是在他们第一次尝试的时候。要是这就是你说的“莫名其妙”，那我就不知道该跟你说什么了。",
    "Funny thing is that sometimes it feels like I've done this whole thing before? I don't know. I think it's the fumes. You kind of lose track of time when you're out here like this, which is part of what I like about it. Lets the mind wander, you know?": "有意思的是，有时候我感觉这整件事以前好像做过？不清楚。可能是烟雾的缘故吧。像这样待在这里，你会有点记不清时间，这也是我喜欢这里的一点。能让思绪随意飘荡，懂吗？",
    "Also, don't you have something better to do? You know, space? Go harass some other lifeform and accuse them of being random. Maybe an Anglerfish. I'm sure they'll like that.": "还有，你就没点更该做的事吗？比如，去太空？去骚扰别的生命体，指责它们莫名其妙。或许安康鱼就不错。我敢肯定它们会乐意的。",

    // Slate Remote（斯雷特-远程）
    "Oh yeah, by the way, Hornfels wanted to talk to you. Said they wanted to mention something real quick while you're up there for the launch codes. No idea what it was about.": "哦对了，顺便说一句，霍恩费斯想跟你谈谈。说你上去拿发射密码的时候，他想赶紧跟你提件事。不知道是关于什么的。",
    "Oh yeah, by the way, Hornfels wanted me to tell you that they're gonna be over at the <![CDATA[<color=orange>Radio Tower</color>]]> for a bit. Something about the peace and quiet helping with their \"productivity\", whatever that means.": "哦对了，顺便说一句，霍恩费斯让我告诉你，他要去<![CDATA[<color=orange>无线电塔</color>]]>待一会儿。说是安静的环境有助于提高他的“创造力”，管它什么意思呢。",
    "I think there's something else they wanted to talk to you about before giving you the launch codes. Not sure what it was, but it seemed important.": "我觉得他在给你发射密码之前，还有别的事想跟你说。不知道是什么事，但看起来挺重要的。",
    "Radio tower? What's that?": "无线电塔？那是什么？",
    "You know, <![CDATA[<i>]]>the<![CDATA[</i>]]><![CDATA[<color=orange> radio tower</color>]]>? The one that's just sitting there right outside of the crater? That one?": "你知道的，就是<![CDATA[<i>]]>那座<![CDATA[</i>]]><![CDATA[<color=orange>无线电塔</color>]]>啊？就在火山口外面孤零零立着的那座？就是那个？",
    "<![CDATA[<color=grey>Sigh...</color>]]><![CDATA[<Pause/>]]> They really just let anyone become a pilot these days. Maybe you should try getting to know your own planet before you head out into <![CDATA[<i>]]>space<![CDATA[</i>]]>. Just a thought.": "<![CDATA[<color=grey>叹气……</color>]]><![CDATA[<Pause/>]]>这年头还真是谁都能当飞船驾驶啊。或许你在进入<![CDATA[<i>]]>太空<![CDATA[</i>]]>之前，应该先试着了解一下自己的星球。只是随口说说。",
    "Since when does Hornfels want to talk to <![CDATA[<i>]]>me<![CDATA[</i>]]>?": "霍恩费斯从什么时候开始想跟<![CDATA[<i>]]>我<![CDATA[</i>]]>谈话了？",
    "You're really starting to get on my nerves.": "你真的开始让我心烦了。",
    "Sure thing.": "没问题。",
    "Since you became an astronaut, idiot! Don't forget that you're a bona fide member of Outer Wilds Ventures, now! Hard to beleive, I know, but it's true.": "因为你成了宇航员啊，笨蛋！别忘了，你现在是星际拓荒探险队的正式成员了！我知道这难以置信，但这是真的。",
    "Since you became an astronaut, idiot! Don't forget that you're a bona fide member of Outer Wilds Ventures, now! Hard to believe, I know, but it's true.": "因为你成了宇航员啊，笨蛋！别忘了，你现在是星际拓荒探险队的正式成员了！我知道这难以置信，但这是真的。",
    "Plus you gotta get the launch codes anyway. Unless you already have them, in which case go do whatever space things you want to do first. Just... try not to crash into the <![CDATA[<color=orange>Observatory</color>]]> on the way back, alright? Last time that happened the whole thing almost caught on fire.": "而且不管怎样你都得拿到发射密码。除非你已经拿到了，那样的话你可以先去做任何你想在太空做的事。只是……回来的时候别撞到<![CDATA[<color=orange>天文台</color>]]>，好吗？上次就差点把整个天文台烧了。",
    "Plus you gotta get the launch codes anyway. Unless you already have them, in which case go do whatever space things you want to do first. Just... try not to crash into anything on the way back, alright? Last time that happened the whole village nearly caught on fire.": "而且不管怎样你都得拿到发射密码。除非你已经拿到了，那样的话你可以先去做任何你想在太空做的事。只是……回来的时候别撞到任何东西，好吗？上次就差点把整个村子烧了。",
    "<![CDATA[<i>]]>Hey!<![CDATA[</i>]]> I'm not the one in the wrong here! I'm just the messenger! It just so happens that I'm the messenger for a lot of different things, because no one else can be bothered to actually tell anyone anything.": "<![CDATA[<i>]]>喂！<![CDATA[</i>]]>这事错不在我！我只是个传信的！只不过我碰巧要传很多不同的消息，因为其他人都懒得真的去告诉别人任何事。",
    "They should still be up at the <![CDATA[<color=orange>Observatory</color>]]>, if I'm not mistaken. You'll have to go there and talk to Hornfels to pick up the launch codes anyway, so you might as well humor them with whatever they're going on about.": "要是我没记错的话，他应该还在<![CDATA[<color=orange>天文台</color>]]>。不管怎样你都得去那儿跟霍恩费斯谈谈，拿到发射密码，所以不妨听听他到底在说些什么。",
    "You'll have to head to the <![CDATA[<color=orange>Radio Tower</color>]]> and talk to Hornfels anyway to pick up the launch codes, so you might as well humor them with whatever they're going on about.": "不管怎样你都得去<![CDATA[<color=orange>无线电塔</color>]]>跟霍恩费斯谈谈，拿到发射密码，所以不妨听听他到底在说些什么。",
    "Shouldn't take too long, in any case. Unless you're one of those Hearthians who considers \"being launched from a geyser pool up to the launch platform\" as \"saving on flight preparation time\", in which case there's no hope for you. ": "不管怎样，应该花不了太长时间。除非你是那种把“从间歇泉池被射到发射台”当成“节省飞行准备时间”的哈斯人，那样的话你就没救了。",
    "Shouldn't take too long, in any case. Unless you're one of those Hearthians who considers \"being launched from a geyser pool up to the launch platform\" as \"saving on flight preparation time\", in which case I'm sure it'll feel like an <![CDATA[<i>]]>eternity<![CDATA[</i>]]>.": "不管怎样，应该花不了太长时间。除非你是那种把“从间歇泉池被射到发射台”当成“节省飞行准备时间”的哈斯人，那样的话我敢肯定这会感觉像<![CDATA[<i>]]>永恒<![CDATA[</i>]]>一样。",
    "I think that's the most agreeable to anything that you've ever been. Should I be worried? Becoming a pilot really does change a Hearthian, huh.": "我觉得这是你有史以来最顺从我的一次了。我该担心吗？成为宇航员真的会改变一个哈斯人啊。",
    "Anyway, just head on up to the <![CDATA[<color=orange>Observatory</color>]]> when you get the chance. Sometimes it feels like they're incapable of leaving.": "不管怎样，有空就去<![CDATA[<color=orange>天文台</color>]]>一趟吧。有时候感觉他都离不开那儿了。",
    "Anyway, just head on over to the <![CDATA[<color=orange>Radio Tower</color>]]> when you get the chance. No idea how you're gonna get there without your suit or ship, but that's not my problem.": "不管怎样，有空就去<![CDATA[<color=orange>无线电塔</color>]]>一趟吧。不知道你没穿宇航服、没开飞船怎么去，但那不是我的事。",

    // Hal（哈尔）
    "Hey, do you know where Hornfels is?": "嘿，你知道霍恩费斯在哪儿吗？",
    "What? Oh, yeah! They wanted me to tell you that they're over by the <![CDATA[<color=orange>Radio Tower</color>]]>. Something about the statue opening its eyes reminding them of something? I dunno.": "什么？哦，对了！他让我告诉你他在<![CDATA[<color=orange>无线电塔</color>]]>那边。好像是说雕像睁开眼睛让他想起了什么？我也不清楚。",
    "Didn't Slate tell you? Hornfels headed over to the <![CDATA[<color=orange>Radio Tower</color>]]> just a minute ago. Something about the statue opening its eyes reminding them of something? I dunno.": "斯雷特没告诉你吗？霍恩费斯几分钟前去<![CDATA[<color=orange>无线电塔</color>]]>了。好像是说雕像睁开眼睛让他想起了什么？我也不清楚。",
    "You should have seen them run out of here, though. It was <![CDATA[<i>]]>wild<![CDATA[</i>]]>. I had no idea Hornfels still had that in them.": "不过你真该看看他从这儿跑出去的样子。那叫一个<![CDATA[<i>]]>疯狂<![CDATA[</i>]]>。真没想到霍恩费斯还有这劲头。",

    // Hornfels（霍恩费斯）
    "Ah, hello! I was just about to radio Gossan to come and find you! Nice to see that you've already gotten on with your first expedition.": "啊，你好！我正要无线电通知古萨来找你呢！真高兴看到你已经开始你的第一次探险了。",
    "I'm not sure if anyone told you, but the statue opened its eyes! Imagine that! Of course, I have absolutely no idea why, but still. It's fascinating.": "不知道有没有人告诉你，那座雕像睁开眼睛了！想想看！当然，我完全不知道为什么，但这依然很吸引人。",
    "What are you doing here?": "你在这儿干什么？",
    "Hey, I'm in a hurry. Can I ask you something?": "嘿，我赶时间。能问你点事吗？",
    "Oh, yes. Certainly. What is it?": "哦，当然可以。什么事？",
    "Oh, well, crunching the numbers as they say. Mainly just wanted to get a little bit of peace and quiet. I tend to come here when the Observatory gets a little too... busy, for my liking - and sometimes it's very helpful for getting a different perspective on things.": "哦，嗯，我就像人们说的在捣鼓数字。主要是想找个安静的地方。天文台太……热闹的时候，我就喜欢来这儿——有时候换个角度看问题很有帮助。",
    "Frankly, all of this ruckus surrounding the statue opening its eyes has proved a little bit too much for me at the moment. And of course Hal is asking a million questions, not that I can blame them.": "说实话，目前围绕雕像睁眼这件事的所有骚动，对我来说有点难以承受。当然，哈尔问个没完没了，不过也不能怪他。",
    "Feel free to look around to your heart's content, if you'd like. These are some of the first images printed of our solar system in its entirety. Of course, not all of them are <![CDATA[<i>]]>perfect<![CDATA[</i>]]>, mind you, but it truly is impressive to look at it all from a distance. See if you can't spot Timber Hearth!": "要是你愿意，尽管随意看看。这些是我们星系全貌的第一批打印图像。当然，它们并非全都是<![CDATA[<i>]]>完美<![CDATA[</i>]]>的，不过从远处看整体真的很壮观。看看你能不能找到木炉星！",
    "Feel free to look around to your heart's content, if you'd like. These are some of the first images printed of our solar system in its entirety!": "要是你愿意，尽管随意看看。这些是我们星系全貌的第一批打印图像！",
    "Of course, not all of them are <![CDATA[<i>]]>perfect<![CDATA[</i>]]>, mind you, but it truly is impressive to look at it all from a distance. See if you can't spot Timber Hearth!": "当然，它们并非全都是<![CDATA[<i>]]>完美<![CDATA[</i>]]>的，不过从远处看整体真的很壮观。看看你能不能找到木炉星！",
    "Anyhow, enough about that. What about you? Anything you need before continuing your maiden voyage among the stars?": "总之，先说这些吧。你呢？在继续你的星际处女航之前，需要什么吗？",
    "Hello again. I'm still trying to wrap my head around why that statue suddenly opened its eyes. <![CDATA[<Pause/>]]><![CDATA[<color=grey>Sigh...</color>]]><![CDATA[<Pause/>]]> Oh well, I suppose I'll figure it out another time.": "又见面了。我还在琢磨那座雕像为什么突然睁开眼睛。<![CDATA[<Pause/>]]><![CDATA[<color=grey>叹气……</color>]]><![CDATA[<Pause/>]]>好吧，我想我下次再弄明白吧。",
    "Hello again. I'm still trying to wrap my head around why that statue suddenly opened its eyes. <![CDATA[<Pause/>]]><![CDATA[<color=grey>Sigh...</color>]]><![CDATA[<Pause/>]]> Oh well, I suppose I'll figure it out eventually.": "又见面了。我还在琢磨那座雕像为什么突然睁开眼睛。<![CDATA[<Pause/>]]><![CDATA[<color=grey>叹气……</color>]]><![CDATA[<Pause/>]]>好吧，我想我最终会弄明白的。",
    "Was there something you needed?": "你有什么需要吗？",
    "Was there something else you needed?": "你还有别的需要吗？",
    "I found something!": "我发现了些东西！",
    "Where are the other travelers?": "其他的探险者在哪里？",
    "Well, let’s see... Chert is on the Hourglass Twins, Riebeck is on Brittle Hollow, and Gabbro is on Giant’s Deep.": "嗯，让我想想……切特在沙漏双星，瑞拜克在碎空星，加布罗在深巨星。",
    "And... there’s Feldspar, obviously, but of course we don’t know where they are, or if they’re even still alive.": "还有……费尔德斯巴，显然，我们不知道他在哪里，甚至不知道他是否还活着。",
    "Feldspar has been lost for a very long time, I’m afraid.": "恐怕费尔德斯巴已经失踪很久了。",
    "Tell me more about Feldspar.": "多告诉我一些关于费尔德斯巴的事。",
    "Feldspar was one of the four founding members of Outer Wilds, along with our flight coach Gossan, Slate the engineer, and me.": "费尔德斯巴是星际拓荒探险队的四位创始成员之一，其他三位是我们的飞行教练古萨、工程师斯雷特和我。",
    "As ground control and later the museum curator, I didn’t work with Feldspar as closely as Slate and Gossan did. I <![CDATA[<i>]]>can<![CDATA[</i>]]> tell you Feldspar was absolutely fearless, though. Nothing scared them.": "作为地面控制员，后来又当了博物馆馆长，我和费尔德斯巴的合作不像斯雷特和古萨那么密切。不过我<![CDATA[<i>]]>可以<![CDATA[</i>]]>告诉你，费尔德斯巴绝对无所畏惧。没什么能吓到他。",
    "Test-piloted everything Slate ever built! It’s a wonder Feldspar lived to see space, frankly, but they did. Flew all sorts of dangerous stunts and explored everything they could find.": "斯雷特造的所有东西，他都试飞了！说实话，费尔德斯巴能活着进入太空真是个奇迹，但他做到了。各种危险的特技飞行，以及探索能找到的东西。",
    "And then one day, they just... didn’t come back. We don’t know what happened, or where Feldspar went, or even whether they’re still alive.": "然后有一天，他就……没回来。我们不知道发生了什么，不知道费尔德斯巴去了哪里，甚至不知道他是否还活着。",
    "It’s been a long time since they left.": "他离开已经很久了。",
    "No thanks, I’m good.": "不用了，谢谢，我没事。",
    "Take care!": "保重！",
    "What did you want to talk to me about?": "你想跟我谈什么？",
    "Did you now? Let's hear it!": "是吗？快说说看！",
    "I found Feldspar!": "我找到费尔德斯巴了！",
    "You found Feldspar?! And they’re in Dark Bramble?! Stars above, this is wonderful news! Thank you! Thank you for finding them!": "你找到费尔德斯巴了？！他在黑棘星？！天哪，这真是个好消息！谢谢你！谢谢你找到他！",
    "That Feldspar didn’t immediately join you on your ship and return here is incredibly Feldspar of them. We were never entirely sure what Feldspar was thinking back then, either.": "费尔德斯巴没有立刻上你的船回来，这太符合他的风格了。其实那时候我们也从来都不太清楚费尔德斯巴在想什么。",
    "Still, we ought to fish them out of that dreadful place with all haste! I’ll radio Gossan and have them prepare a ship. It really should be Gossan who brings Feldspar home.": "不过，我们还是得赶紧把他从那个可怕的地方救出来！我会用无线电通知古萨，让他准备一艘飞船。真该让古萨把费尔德斯巴带回家。",
    "Again, thank you. You can hardly imagine how profoundly happy I am to hear they’re alive and unharmed.": "再次感谢你。你很难想象听到他平安无事，我有多高兴。",
    "The Nomai statue opened its eyes!": "挪麦雕像睁开眼睛了！",
    "Actually, nevermind.": "其实，没什么。",
    "Ah. Well, if you do come across anything in your travels that you feel is worth mentioning, I would love to hear it.": "啊。好吧，如果你在旅途中遇到任何你觉得值得一提的事，我很乐意听。",
    "Oh... yes, that. I suppose Slate told you, then?": "哦……是那件事啊。我猜斯雷特告诉你了吧？",
    "I wasn't going to mention it since this is your first expedition, but something about that statue opening its eyes convinced me otherwise.": "因为这是你的第一次探险，我本来不想提的，但雕像睁眼这件事让我改变了想法。",
    "A bit before your time, and before Feldspar went missing, there was another traveler. A Hatchling. Quite like you, in fact.": "在你之前不久，在费尔德斯巴失踪之前，还有另一个探险者。一个新手。其实和你很像。",
    "They were one of the first of the new generation of Outer Wilds Ventures that came after of the four of us -- that being me, Slate, Gossan, and of course Feldspar. They were quite taken with the name \"Acetate\" of all things, something that was of their own invention by the way, but I have never seen a traveller so enamored with the Hearthian spirit as they were.": "他是我们四人——也就是我、斯雷特、古萨，当然还有费尔德斯巴——之后的新一代星际拓荒探险队的第一批成员之一。他对“阿西泰特”这个名字情有独钟，顺便说一句，这是他自己起的，但我从未见过有哪个探险者像他那样痴迷于哈斯精神。",
    "They were one of the first of the new generation of Outer Wilds Ventures that came after of the four of us - that being me, Slate, Gossan, and of course Feldspar. They were quite taken with the name \"Acetate\" of all things, something that was of their own invention by the way, but I have never seen a traveller so enamored with the Hearthian spirit as they were.": "他是我们四人——也就是我、斯雷特、古萨，当然还有费尔德斯巴——之后的新一代星际拓荒探险队的第一批成员之一。他对“阿西泰特”这个名字情有独钟，顺便说一句，这是他自己起的，但我从未见过有哪个探险者像他那样痴迷于哈斯精神。",
    "They were one of the first of the new generation of Outer Wilds Ventures that came after of the four of us — that being me, Slate, Gossan, and of course Feldspar. They were quite taken with the name \"Acetate\" of all things, something that was of their own invention by the way, but I have never seen a traveller so enamored with the Hearthian spirit as they were.": "他是我们四人——也就是我、斯雷特、古萨，当然还有费尔德斯巴——之后的新一代星际拓荒探险队的第一批成员之一。他对“阿西泰特”这个名字情有独钟，顺便说一句，这是他自己起的，但我从未见过有哪个探险者像他那样痴迷于哈斯精神。",
    "That is, of course, until one day -- even more suddenly than Feldspar -- they went out to the edge of the solar system and just... disappeared. No one knows why. With Feldspar I expected it, as much as I hate to admit, but with Acetate... I can't even begin to imagine how that would happen.": "当然，直到有一天——比费尔德斯巴失踪还要突然——他去了太阳系的边缘，然后就……消失了。没人知道为什么。尽管我不愿承认，但费尔德斯巴的失踪我是有预料的，可阿西泰特……我根本无法想象会发生这种事。",
    "That is, of course, until one day - even more suddenly than Feldspar - they went out to the edge of the solar system and just... disappeared. No one knows why. With Feldspar I expected it, as much as I hate to admit, but with Acetate... I can't even begin to imagine how that would happen.": "当然，直到有一天——比费尔德斯巴失踪还要突然——他去了太阳系的边缘，然后就……消失了。没人知道为什么。尽管我不愿承认，但费尔德斯巴的失踪我是有预料的，可阿西泰特……我根本无法想象会发生这种事。",
    "That is, of course, until one day — even more suddenly than Feldspar — they went out to the edge of the solar system and just... disappeared. No one knows why. With Feldspar I expected it, as much as I hate to admit, but with Acetate... I can't even begin to imagine how that would happen.": "当然，直到有一天——比费尔德斯巴失踪还要突然——他去了太阳系的边缘，然后就……消失了。没人知道为什么。尽管我不愿承认，但费尔德斯巴的失踪我是有预料的，可阿西泰特……我根本无法想象会发生这种事。",
    "Could you find out what happened to them for me? I know that it's a big ask, but if you at some point find anything that could give us - or me - some closure, I would greatly appreciate it.": "你能帮我查明他出了什么事吗？我知道这是个不情之请，但如果你在某个时候发现任何能让我们——或者说让我——有所放心的线索，我会非常感激的。",
    "Could you find out what happened to them for me? I know that it's a big ask, but if you at some point find anything that could give us — or me — some closure, I would greatly appreciate it.": "你能帮我查明他出了什么事吗？我知道这是个不情之请，但如果你在某个时候发现任何能让我们——或者说让我——有所放心的线索，我会非常感激的。",
    "Where should I start?": "我该从哪里开始呢？",
    "The last place that they went to before they went missing was the <![CDATA[<color=orange>Lunar Outpost</color>]]>, on the Attlerock. We don't use it much anymore, but back in the day it was vital for the exploration of our solar system.": "他失踪前最后去的地方是废岩星上的<![CDATA[<color=orange>月球前哨站</color>]]>。我们现在不怎么用它了，但在过去，它对我们探索太阳系至关重要。",
    "I'd ask Esker if they remember anything about it, on the off chance that they do. It seems to me that there aren't really any leads as to where Acetate could have gone, unfortunately, and I don't necessarily expect for you to find anything useful on your own.": "我会问问埃斯科，看他是否还记得些什么，虽然可能性不大。不幸的是，在我看来，关于阿西泰特可能去了哪里，真的没有任何线索，所以我也不一定指望你能独自找到什么有用的东西。",
    "Still though, it's nice to get a new pair of eyes on it after all of these years. I won't be too dissapointed if you don't get anywhere, but at the same time I very much appreciate your willingness to help. It's hard to get over the guilt of something terrible happening to someone under your watch, especially when I was the one who encouraged them to become an astronaut in the first place.": "尽管如此，这么多年后能有新的人关注这件事，还是很好的。如果你一无所获，我也不会太失望，但同时我非常感谢你愿意帮忙。看着自己照管的人遭遇不幸，这种愧疚很难释怀，尤其是当初还是我鼓励他成为宇航员的。",
    "Still though, it's nice to get a new set of eyes on it after all of these years. It's hard to get over the guilt of something terrible happening to someone under your watch, especially when I was the one who encouraged them to become an astronaut in the first place.": "尽管如此，这么多年后能有新的人关注这件事，还是很好的。看着自己照管的人遭遇不幸，这种愧疚很难释怀，尤其是当初还是我鼓励他成为宇航员的。",
    "Did you need anything else while you were here? It wasn't my intent to keep you, and I would be very interested in anything else that you have to say. If you do learn anything about Acetate, however, do not hesitate to let me know.": "你在这里还有别的需要吗？我没打算留你在这里，你要是有任何其他事情想说，我都很感兴趣。不过，如果你了解到任何关于阿西泰特的事，一定要马上告诉我。",
    "Forgive me. I do realize that you're likely itching to get back to exploring. Was there something else you wished to discuss before heading off?": "抱歉。我知道你可能迫不及待想回去继续探险了。出发前还有别的想聊的吗？",
    "Anything else you need me to do before I launch?": "我发射前还有什么需要做的吗？",
    "Hmmm. There was one thing that I wanted to ask you about. I wasn't going to mention it since this is your first expedition, but considering all of the other travelers are currently preoccupied or are entirely unhelpful, I suppose now is as much of an appropriate time as any.": "嗯。我有一件事想问你。因为这是你的第一次探险，我本来不想提的，但考虑到其他探险者现在要么很忙，要么完全帮不上忙，我想现在或许是个合适的时机。",
    "Anyhow, don't let me keep you. I'm sure you're just itching to get back to your expedition!": "总之，别让我耽误你了。我知道你肯定迫不及待想回去继续探险了！",
    "What's that dark spot in that photograph?": "那张照片里的黑点是什么？",
    "Ah, so you noticed that too, did you? Chert thinks it has something to do with Dark Bramble, but my working theory is that it was actually the result of a perfectly-timed blast of solar radiation in the orbital path of satellite.": "啊，你也注意到了，是吧？切特认为这和黑棘星有关，但我的初步理论是，这实际上是卫星轨道上一次时机恰到好处的太阳辐射爆发的结果。",
    "Ah, so you noticed that too, did you? Chert thinks it has something to do with Dark Bramble, but my theory is that it was actually the result of a perfectly-timed blast of solar radiation in the orbital path of satellite.": "啊，你也注意到了，是吧？切特认为这和黑棘星有关，但我的理论是，这实际上是卫星轨道上一次时机恰到好处的太阳辐射爆发的结果。",
    "Luckily it seems to have caused no permanent damage, considering Gabbro didn't find anything wrong with the equipment. I suppose there could be another explanation for it, but I'm almost certain it was just an extraordinary coincidence.": "幸运的是，这似乎没有造成永久性损坏。考虑到加布罗没发现设备有任何问题，或许还有别的解释，但我几乎可以肯定这只是个罕见的巧合。",
    "Luckily it caused no permanent damage, considering Gabbro didn't find anything wrong with the equipment. I suppose there could be another explanation for it, but I'm almost certain it was just an extraordinary coincidence.": "幸运的是，这没有造成永久性损坏。考虑到加布罗没发现设备有任何问题，或许还有别的解释，但我几乎可以肯定这只是个罕见的巧合。",
    "On a related note, I almost debated on using that particular photograph as kindling for my campfire out there, but I figure that its historical significance far outweighs a little blemish with a fascinating origin story.": "顺带一提，我差点就把那张照片当营火的引火物了，但我觉得它的历史意义远大于那个有着有趣由来的小瑕疵。",
    "On a related note, I almost debated on using that particular photograph as kindling for my campfire out there, but I figure that its historical significance far outweighs any of its \"imperfections\", as it were.": "顺带一提，我差点就把那张照片当营火的引火物了，但我觉得它的历史意义远大于那些所谓的“瑕疵”。",
    "Anything else that you're curious about before continuing with your expedition?": "继续探险前，你还有别的好奇的事吗？",
    "I found an entirely new alien civilization hidden within our star system!": "我在我们的星系里发现了一个全新的外星文明！",
    "By the stars, that <![CDATA[<i>]]>is<![CDATA[</i>]]> fascinating! It was always my hope that you'd uncover something truly groundbreaking. And on your first expedition no less!": "我的天，这<![CDATA[<i>]]>太<![CDATA[</i>]]>有意思了！我一直希望你能有真正突破性的发现。而且还是在你的第一次探险中！",
    "Perhaps we should hold a ceremony of sorts? Something which is fitting for such a profound discovery, and celebrates your accomplishments as the newest member of Outer Wilds Ventures.": "或许我们该办个仪式之类的？既符合这个重大发现的规格，也能庆祝你作为星际拓荒探险队最新成员所取得的成就。",
    "Do give me a few days to get everything sorted. I also ask that you hold off on telling the others for now — I'd love for everyone to be together when we go and break the news.": "请给我几天时间安排好一切。另外，目前请你先别告诉其他人——我希望我们宣布这个消息时，大家都能在场。",
    "On second thought, perhaps you should be the one to tell Riebeck of your discovery? I'm sure they would be delighted to be one of the first to hear about it!": "等等，或许你应该亲自把你的发现告诉瑞拜克？我相信他会很乐意成为第一批知道这个消息的人！",
    "Anyhow, don't let me distract from learning more about this new species. All I ask is that your bring something back with you for the mueseum!": "总之，别让我耽误你去了解这个新种族。我只希望你能给博物馆带点东西回来！",
    "I think I know what happened to Acetate...": "我想我知道阿西泰特出了什么事……",
    "I see. I must say, I didn't expect to hear that, after all these years.": "我明白了。说实话，这么多年后听到这个消息，我完全没预料到。",
    "I knew deep down, I suppose. If what you're saying is true, even if they did find this \"Eye of the Universe\", I can't imagine that they've survived all these years out there on their own.": "我想，我内心深处其实是知道的。如果你说的是真的，就算他找到了“宇宙之眼”，我也无法想象他能独自在外存活这么多年。",
    "Still though, thank you. It'll take me a bit to understand everything you've told me. The truth is painful at times, but it's better to stare it in the face than to close your eyes to it.": "尽管如此，还是谢谢你。我需要点时间才能完全理解你告诉我的一切。真相有时是痛苦的，但直面它总比视而不见好。",
    "Forgive me. I don't mean for this to distract from your expedition. I will be alright — perhaps this time away from the others will do me good.": "抱歉。我不想让这件事耽误你的探险。我没事的——或许暂时远离大家对我有好处。",
    "Ah, hello again. I do hope that you're still getting on with your expedition, despite the circumstances. I am certain that's what Acetate would've wanted.": "啊，又见面了。无论如何，我真心希望你还在继续你的探险。我相信这也是阿西泰特希望的。",

    // Esker（埃斯科）
    "Do you know anything about Acetate?": "你知道阿西泰特的事吗？",
    "Acetate, huh? <![CDATA[<Pause/>]]>Now that's a name that I haven't heard in a very, <![CDATA[<i>]]>very<![CDATA[</i>]]> long time.": "阿西泰特啊？<![CDATA[<Pause/>]]>这名字我真的、<![CDATA[<i>]]>真的<![CDATA[</i>]]>很多年没听过了。",
    "Well, as a matter of fact, Acetate was the last member of Outer Wilds Ventures to actually use this outpost. Also part of the reason that we stopped, too. <![CDATA[<Pause/>]]><![CDATA[<color=grey>Sigh...</color>]]> A real Feldspar, that one.": "其实，阿西泰特是星际拓荒探险队里最后一个真正使用过这个前哨站的成员。这也是我们停用这里的部分原因。<![CDATA[<Pause/>]]><![CDATA[<color=grey>叹气……</color>]]>他跟费尔德斯巴真像啊。",
    "<![CDATA[<i>]]>Incredibly<![CDATA[</i>]]> smart, though. A little too much, if you ask me. I suppose that's why Hornfels is still so hung up on it after all of these years. Someone like that doesn't really <![CDATA[<i>]]>go<![CDATA[</i>]]> missing.": "不过他是真的<![CDATA[<i>]]>特别<![CDATA[</i>]]>聪明。说实话，有点聪明过头了。我想这就是这么多年后霍恩费斯还对他念念不忘的原因。像他那样的人，不该就这么失踪的。",
    "Do you have any idea where they could have gone?": "你知道他可能去了哪里吗？",
    "Not really. The travelers don't really tell me those sorts of things anymore. <![CDATA[<size=20>]]>Not that they ever did.<![CDATA[</size>]]> Frankly Acetate could have ended up anywhere by now.": "不太清楚。探险者们现在都不怎么跟我说这些事了。<![CDATA[<size=20>]]>以前也没怎么说过。<![CDATA[</size>]]>说实话，现在阿西泰特可能在任何地方。",
    "I do remember hearing though that they wanted to do something before they cut themselves lose. Something about scouting a good location for Hornfels' <![CDATA[<color=orange>Deep Space Satellite</color>]]>, I forget the details. Don't know what happened to them after that.": "不过我记得他离开前好像想做点什么。好像是要帮霍恩费斯找个适合设置<![CDATA[<color=orange>深空卫星</color>]]>的地方，具体细节记不清了。之后他就没消息了。",
    "I do remember hearing that they wanted to do something before they cut themselves loose. Something about scouting a good location for Hornfels' <![CDATA[<color=orange>Deep Space Satellite</color>]]>, I forget the details. Don't know what happened to them after that.": "不过我记得他离开前好像想做点什么。好像是要帮霍恩费斯找个适合设置<![CDATA[<color=orange>深空卫星</color>]]>的地方，具体细节记不清了。之后他就没消息了。",
    "Was that helpful? Honestly you probably know more about this whole thing than I do at this point. Good luck on the search, though! Hope you find them.": "这些对你有帮助吗？说实话，现在你可能比我更了解整件事。不过祝你搜索顺利！希望你能找到他。",

