    "Confirming validity of remote signal interface for Shrouded Woodlands...": "验证覆盖林地远程信号接口有效性中……",
    "ERROR: Cannot confirm validity of remote signal interfaces. REASON: One or more interfaces are not configured or are invalid!": "错误：无法确认远程信号接口有效性。原因：一个或多个接口未配置或无效！",
    "All remote interfaces active and callibrated. Awaiting input...": "所有远程接口已激活并校准。等待输入……",
    "All interfaces valid. Signal transmission capability is online and ready. Begin transmission?": "所有接口有效。信号传输功能已在线并就绪。是否开始传输？",
    "Yes.": "是。",
    "No.": "否。",
    "Establishing connection to intermediary relay satellite...": "建立与中继卫星的连接中……",
    "Connection established.": "连接已建立。",
    "Beginning transmission... ": "开始传输……",
    "Transmission received. Transmission target identified as <![CDATA[<color=orange>Signal Capture Satelite</color>]]>. All systems operational. Currently in orbit around <![CDATA[<color=orange>Universal Center</color>]]>.": "已接收传输内容。传输目标识别为<![CDATA[<color=orange>信号捕捉卫星</color>]]>。所有系统正常运行。当前围绕<![CDATA[<color=orange>宇宙中心</color>]]>轨道运行。",
    "Canceling outbound transmission...": "取消向外传输中……",
    "Verify status of satellite operation.": "验证卫星运行状态。",
    "Broadcast location of Signal Capture Satellite. ": "广播信号捕捉卫星位置。",
    "Disable signal capture net.": "禁用信号捕捉网。",
    "End transmission.": "结束传输。",
    "Verifying status of satellite operation...": "验证卫星运行状态中……",
    "OPERATIONAL STATUS: OK": "运行状态：正常",
    "POWER: OK": "电力：正常",
    "SIGNAL CAPTURE NET: OK": "信号捕捉网：正常",
    "WARNING: Direct connection unavailable! Transmission is currently in receive-only mode!": "警告：无法建立直接连接！当前传输处于仅接收模式！",
    "Identifying approximate location of Signal Capture Satellite...": "识别信号捕捉卫星大致位置中……",
    "Location identified. Current estimated travel time with transport pilgrim is 43 minutes, 25 seconds. Proceed? ": "已识别位置。朝圣者运输船当前预计航行时间为43分25秒。是否继续？",
    "Broadcasting location of Signal Capture Satellite...": "广播信号捕捉卫星位置中……",
    "Broadcasting location of Signal Capture Satellite to...": "向以下目标广播信号捕捉卫星位置……",
    "Transport Pilgrim #1: DOCKED, Transport Pilgrim #2: ACTIVE (IN TRANSIT), Transport Pilgrim #3: DOCKED, Transport Pilgrim #4: DOCKED": "朝圣者运输船#1：停泊中\n朝圣者运输船#2：活跃（航行中）\n朝圣者运输船#3：停泊中\n朝圣者运输船#4：停泊中",
    "Transport Pilgrim #1: DOCKED, Transport Pilgrim #2: ACTIVE [IN TRANSIT], Transport Pilgrim #3: DOCKED, Transport Pilgrim #4: DOCKED": "朝圣者运输船#1：停泊中\n朝圣者运输船#2：活跃 [航行中]\n朝圣者运输船#3：停泊中\n朝圣者运输船#4：停泊中",
    "Transport Pilgrim #5: DOCKED, Transport Pilgrim #6: DOCKED, Transport Pilgrim #7: DOCKED, Transport Pilgrim #8: DOCKED": "朝圣者运输船#5：停泊中\n朝圣者运输船#6：停泊中\n朝圣者运输船#7：停泊中\n朝圣者运输船#8：停泊中",
    "WARNING: <![CDATA[<color=orange>Transport Pilgrim #2</color>]]> is currently in emergency mode! Distress signal is active but is currently out of range.": "警告：<![CDATA[<color=orange>朝圣者运输船#2</color>]]>当前处于紧急模式！救援信号已激活，但当前已超出信号范围。",
    "Diagnose condition of Transport Pilgrim #2.": "诊断朝圣者运输船#2状态。",
    "Auto-recall Transport Pilgrim #2.": "自动召回朝圣者运输船#2。",
    "Proceed.": "继续。",
    "<![CDATA[<color=orange>Transport Pilgrim #2</color>]]> is currently in emergency mode and is broadcasting an active distress signal. Last contact was 5 years, 4 weeks, 3 days, and 6 hours ago. Unknown position relative to <![CDATA[<color=orange>Universal Center</color>]]>. Last known celestial body for emergency landing was <![CDATA[<color=orange>Wandering Moon</color>]]>.": "<![CDATA[<color=orange>朝圣者运输船#2</color>]]>当前处于紧急模式，并正在广播救援信号。上次联系时间为5年4周3天6小时前。相对于<![CDATA[<color=orange>宇宙中心</color>]]>的位置未知。最后已知紧急着陆天体为<![CDATA[<color=orange>流浪卫星</color>]]>。",
    "ERROR: Cannot auto-recall Transport Pilgrim #2. Reason: Out of range. ": "错误：无法自动召回朝圣者运输船#2。原因：超出范围。",
    "Broadcasted location of Signal Capture Satellite.": "已广播信号捕捉卫星位置。",
    "Canceling broadcast of Signal Capture Satellite location...": "取消信号捕捉卫星位置广播中……",
    "ERROR: Operation not permitted. Reason: Permission denied.": "错误：操作未授权。原因：权限不足。",
    "ERROR: Operation not permitted. REASON: Permission denied.": "错误：操作未授权。原因：权限不足。",
    "Ending transmission with Signal Capture Satellite...": "结束与信号捕捉卫星的传输……",
    "Reestablish connection with Signal Capture Satelite.": "重新建立与信号捕捉卫星的连接。",
    "WARNING: Performing this operation will result in a significant divergence from reccomended power targets. Reduction in long-term viability of simulation context is likely. Proceed anyway?": "警告：执行此操作将导致与推荐功率目标大幅偏离。可能会降低模拟现实的长期可用性。是否仍要继续？",
    "WARNING: Performing this operation will result in a significant divergence from recommended power targets. Reduction in long-term viability of simulation context is likely. Proceed anyway?": "警告：执行此操作将导致与推荐功率目标大幅偏离。可能会降低模拟现实的长期可用性。是否仍要继续？",
    "Configuring communications array for outbound transmission...": "配置通信阵列以进行向外传输……",
    "Array configured for specified coordinate set. Beginning transmission... ": "已根据指定坐标集配置阵列。开始传输……",
    "Array configured for specified coordinate set. Beginning transmission...": "已根据指定坐标集配置阵列。开始传输……",
    "Reestablishing connection to <![CDATA[<color=orange>Signal Capture Satelite</color>]]>... ": "重新建立与<![CDATA[<color=orange>信号捕捉卫星</color>]]>的连接中……",
    "Reestablishing connection to <![CDATA[<color=orange>Signal Capture Satelite</color>]]>...": "重新建立与<![CDATA[<color=orange>信号捕捉卫星</color>]]>的连接中……",
    "Connection established. All systems operational. Currently in orbit around <![CDATA[<color=orange>Universal Center</color>]]>.": "连接已建立。所有系统正常运行。当前围绕<![CDATA[<color=orange>宇宙中心</color>]]>轨道运行。",

    // Acetate_ShipBay（阿西泰特-飞船舱）
    "Well, what do you know? For all the genius of Hearthian ingenuity, all that's left of my ship after its unfortunate demise is the chair. The <![CDATA[<i>]]>chair<![CDATA[</i>]]>. Can you believe that?": "你敢信吗？哈斯人再怎么心灵手巧，我的飞船不幸报废后，也就只剩这把椅子了。就这<![CDATA[<i>]]>一把椅子<![CDATA[</i>]]>。你能相信吗？",
    "It's probably the most flammable thing in the entire ship, and yet somehow I found it floating around out there without so much as a scratch on it. I mean it withstood the reactor blowing up right next to it without so much as a <![CDATA[<i>]]>burn<![CDATA[</i>]]>. It's ridiculous. <![CDATA[<size=20>]]>(And no, Slate, more reactor power does not mean \"more better\", it just means I don't have a ship anymore. So thanks for that.)<![CDATA[</size>]]>": "这椅子说不定是整艘船里最容易烧起来的东西，可不知怎么的，我发现它在外面飘着，居然一点划痕都没有。我是说，反应堆就在它旁边爆炸，它居然<![CDATA[<i>]]>一点都没烧到<![CDATA[</i>]]>。简直离谱。<![CDATA[<size=20>]]>（还有，斯雷特，反应堆功率越高不代表“越好”，这只会让我连船都没了。所以“谢谢你”啊。）<![CDATA[</size>]]>",
    "I'll have to haul it up to my camp <![CDATA[<color=orange>at the top of the dam</color>]]> when I get the chance, but considering that's on the complete opposite side of this thing I figure that'll be a while. For now it'll just sit here ominously to scare the newcomers. <![CDATA[<Pause/>]]>Like you. <![CDATA[<Pause/>]]><![CDATA[<b>]]>Boo! <![CDATA[</b>]]><![CDATA[<size=20>]]>Gotcha, didn't I?<![CDATA[</size>]]>": "有空的时候，我得把它搬到<![CDATA[<color=orange>水坝顶部</color>]]>的营地去，但那地方在这玩意儿的正对面，估计得等一阵子了。现在嘛，就让它在这儿阴森森地杵着，吓吓新来的人好了。<![CDATA[<Pause/>]]>比如你。<![CDATA[<Pause/>]]><![CDATA[<b>]]>哇！<![CDATA[</b>]]><![CDATA[<size=20>]]>吓到你了吧？<![CDATA[</size>]]>",
    "I'll have to haul it up to my rinky-dink little sleeping bag setup in the <![CDATA[<color=orange>building that's connected to the dam</color>]]> when I get the chance, but considering that's on the complete opposite side of this thing I figure that'll be a while. For now it'll just sit here ominously to scare the newcomers. <![CDATA[<Pause/>]]>Like you. <![CDATA[<Pause/>]]><![CDATA[<b>]]>Boo! <![CDATA[</b>]]><![CDATA[<size=20>]]>Gotcha, didn't I?<![CDATA[</size>]]>": "有空的时候，我得把它搬到<![CDATA[<color=orange>连在水坝上的那栋楼</color>]]>里我那简陋的睡袋旁，但那地方在这玩意儿的正对面，估计得等一阵子了。现在嘛，就让它在这儿阴森森地杵着，吓吓新来的人好了。<![CDATA[<Pause/>]]>比如你。<![CDATA[<Pause/>]]><![CDATA[<b>]]>哇！<![CDATA[</b>]]><![CDATA[<size=20>]]>吓到你了吧？<![CDATA[</size>]]>",
    "Hope you're not afraid of ghosts, because this chair is definitely haunted. This whole place is <![CDATA[<i>]]>super<![CDATA[</i>]]> haunted, but so is this chair. I don't trust it.": "希望你不怕鬼，因为这把椅子绝对有鬼附身。这地方整个都<![CDATA[<i>]]>超级<![CDATA[</i>]]>邪门，但这椅子更邪门。我信不过它。",

    // Acetate_Entrance（阿西泰特-入口）
    "Uh, well... I guess now is the time that I start documenting everything that I do here, for posterity. No idea where I'm supposed to start. I'm guessing I would tell you how I got here, but you probably already know that, considering that you likely got here the same way I did.": "呃，好吧……我想现在该开始记录我在这里做的所有事，留给后人看了。不知道该从哪开始。按理说该说说我是怎么到这儿的，但想想你很可能也是用同样的方式来的，说不定已经知道了。",
    "Pretty much blew up my ship trying to fly around this thing. Barely got out before the reactor went off. No idea if there's even anything left of it floating around out there. ": "我试着绕着这玩意儿飞，结果飞船差点炸了。反应堆爆炸前我勉强逃了出来。不知道外面还有没有残骸飘着。",
    "I'm telling you though, this thing is <![CDATA[<i>]]>massive<![CDATA[</i>]]>. I wonder who could have built it. It's obviously not Nomai or Hearthian in origin, but no one else was known to live in our solar system besides that. But where could they have come from, and what were they doing here? How long has this been here without anyone knowing?": "不过我跟你说，这玩意儿是真的<![CDATA[<i>]]>巨大<![CDATA[</i>]]>。真不知道是谁造的。显然不是挪麦人或哈斯人的东西，但除此之外，我们星系里没听说过还有别的智慧生命。他们到底是从哪来的？在这儿做什么？这东西在没人知道的情况下存在多久了？",
    "I'm telling you though, this thing is <![CDATA[<i>]]>massive<![CDATA[</i>]]>. I wonder who could've built it. It clearly wasn't made by the Nomai, and they're the only ones besides us that lived in this system, so this must've have been built by a completely different civilization. But where did they come from, and what were they doing here? How long has this been here without anyone knowing?": "不过我跟你说，这玩意儿是真的<![CDATA[<i>]]>巨大<![CDATA[</i>]]>。真不知道是谁造的。显然不是挪麦人做的，而除了我们，只有挪麦人在这个星系生活过，所以这肯定是另一个完全不同的文明造的。他们到底是从哪来的？在这儿做什么？这东西在没人知道的情况下存在多久了？",
    "I'm telling you though, this thing is <![CDATA[<i>]]>massive<![CDATA[</i>]]>. I wonder who could've built it. It clearly wasn't made by the Nomai, and they're the only ones besides us that lived in this system, so this must've been built by a completely alien civilization. But where did they come from, and what were they doing here? How long has this been here without anyone knowing?": "不过我跟你说，这玩意儿是真的<![CDATA[<i>]]>巨大<![CDATA[</i>]]>。真不知道是谁造的。显然不是挪麦人做的，而除了我们，只有挪麦人在这个星系生活过，所以这肯定是另一个完全陌生的文明造的。他们到底是从哪来的？在这儿做什么？这东西在没人知道的情况下存在多久了？",
    "First things first though, I wanted to head down to that burned out building near the <![CDATA[<color=orange>tower</color>]]> that's down the river there. Might be a more central place to set up camp, though for now it might be best to stick to hanging around the entrances. At least until I can get into one of those ships downstairs.": "不过当务之急，我想去河边那座<![CDATA[<color=orange>塔楼</color>]]>附近那栋烧毁的楼看看。那儿说不定适合当营地的中心位置，但现在最好还是先在入口附近待着。至少等我能进楼下那些飞船里再说。",
    "First things first though, I wanted to head down to that <![CDATA[<color=orange>burned out building</color>]]> near the <![CDATA[<color=orange>tower</color>]]> that's down the river there. Might be a more central place to set up camp, though for now it might be best to stick to hanging around the entrances. At least until I can get into one of those ships downstairs.": "不过当务之急，我想去河边那座<![CDATA[<color=orange>塔楼</color>]]>附近那栋<![CDATA[<color=orange>烧毁的楼</color>]]>看看。那儿说不定适合当营地的中心位置，但现在最好还是先在入口附近待着。至少等我能进楼下那些飞船里再说。",
    "But man, talk about a good view. You don't get anything nearly this scenic on Timber Hearth. Can't wait to see how the others will react when I tell them the news.": "不过说真的，这景色绝了。在木炉星可看不到这么美的风景。真想快点告诉其他人这个消息，看看他们会是什么反应。",

    // Acetate_EyeShrine（阿西泰特-眼之圣地）
    "I still don't exactly understand why they did a lot of the things that they did. Some of them I do, as strange as it sounds, but the rest of it still seems so foreign to me.": "我还是不太明白他们为什么要做那么多奇怪的事。虽说有些事我能理解，听起来可能有点离谱，但其他的事对我来说还是太陌生了。",
    "Did it betray them? Was what they saw so terrible that they had no choice but to denounce it wholly and completely? They burned it all down, and hid it all away. Who were they trying to hide it from? Was what they were doing purely out of fear, or were they somehow justified?": "是它背叛了他们吗？他们看到的东西就那么可怕，以至于只能彻底否定它？他们烧毁了一切，把一切都藏了起来。他们到底想瞒着谁？他们这么做只是因为害怕，还是有什么正当理由？",
    "Why was their reaction so extreme? They burned their culture to the ground, and hid it all away. Who were they trying to hide it from? Did they do what they did completely out of fear, or were they somehow justified?": "他们的反应为什么这么极端？烧毁了自己的文化，把一切都藏了起来。他们到底想瞒着谁？他们这么做只是因为害怕，还是有什么正当理由？",
    "There's something about the tower in the <![CDATA[<color=orange>Cinder Isles</color>]]> that's the key to figuring out their secret. I don't completely know what yet, but there has to be more to all of this than it appears on the surface. The fact that the codes are gone in <![CDATA[<i>]]>both<![CDATA[</i>]]> places is what's bugging me, because while I understand them being gone here, what I don't understand them not being <![CDATA[<i>]]>anywhere<![CDATA[</i>]]>. I'll leave a log in the tower's code room with anything else I find.": "<![CDATA[<color=orange>余烬群岛</color>]]>的那座塔楼里，一定藏着解开他们秘密的关键。我还没完全弄明白是什么，但这一切肯定不止表面看起来那么简单。让我头疼的是，两个地方的密码都不见了——这里的密码消失我能理解，可为什么<![CDATA[<i>]]>到处都找不到<![CDATA[</i>]]>？如果再发现别的线索，我会把记录留在塔楼的密码室里。",
    "There's something about the <![CDATA[<color=orange>tower in the Cinder Isles</color>]]> that's the key to figuring out their secret. I don't completely know what yet, but there has to be more to all of this than it appears on the surface. The fact that the codes are gone in <![CDATA[<i>]]>both<![CDATA[</i>]]> places is what's bugging me, because while I understand them being gone here, what I don't understand them not being <![CDATA[<i>]]>anywhere<![CDATA[</i>]]>. I'll leave a log in the tower's code room with anything else I find.": "<![CDATA[<color=orange>余烬群岛的塔楼</color>]]>里，一定藏着解开他们秘密的关键。我还没完全弄明白是什么，但这一切肯定不止表面看起来那么简单。让我头疼的是，两个地方的密码都不见了——这里的密码消失我能理解，可为什么<![CDATA[<i>]]>到处都找不到<![CDATA[</i>]]>？如果再发现别的线索，我会把记录留在塔楼的密码室里。",
    "The <![CDATA[<color=orange>signal blocker</color>]]>. The lab. The dreams. There's something else connecting them besides the vault, I just have to figure out what.": "<![CDATA[<color=orange>信号屏蔽器</color>]]>、实验室、梦境。除了储藏库，它们之间一定还有别的联系，我必须弄清楚是什么。",
    "The <![CDATA[<color=orange>signal blocker</color>]]>. The dreams. There's something else connecting them besides the vault, I just have to figure out what.": "<![CDATA[<color=orange>信号屏蔽器</color>]]>、梦境。除了储藏库，它们之间一定还有别的联系，我必须弄清楚是什么。",
    "The <![CDATA[<color=orange>signal blocker</color>]]>. The artifact lab. The dreams. There's something else connecting them besides the vault, I just have to figure out what.": "<![CDATA[<color=orange>信号屏蔽器</color>]]>、文物实验室、梦境。除了储藏库，它们之间一定还有别的联系，我必须弄清楚是什么。",

    // Acetate_CodeRoom（阿西泰特-密码室）
    "I knew it. I had a hunch that there was more to it before, but now this confirms it. This really is big.": "我就知道！我之前就隐约觉得没那么简单，现在终于证实了。这事儿太重大了。",
    "For anyone who comes after me, and who is following the same path: They're not just codes. They're <![CDATA[<i>]]>interfaces<![CDATA[</i>]]>. By the stars, why didn't I think of it sooner?": "给所有追随我的脚步来到这里的人：这些不只是密码。它们是<![CDATA[<i>]]>接口<![CDATA[</i>]]>。天啊，我怎么没早点想到？",
    "For anyone who comes after me, each of these burned codes has an equivalent hidden within the \"dreams\". Unfortunately those appear to be burned as well, and so initially I thought they were completely useless.": "给所有追随我的脚步来到这里的人：每个烧毁的密码，在“梦境”里都有对应的隐藏版本。可惜那些似乎也被烧毁了，所以一开始我以为它们完全没用。",
    "There are three signals coming from the top of tower which correspond to each one of the \"dreams\". You can't hear them unless you use your signalscope, but the key is that each of them is equivalent to an individual seal, as you can see here. ": "塔楼顶部会发出三个信号，分别对应每个“梦境”。不用信号镜根本听不到，但关键是——如你所见，每个信号都对应一个独立的封印。",
    "However, once I figured out how to \"talk\" to them, I realized that they were secretly the solution to all of this. All I need to do is input the right things in the right order...": "但一旦我弄明白怎么和它们“沟通”，就发现它们其实是解开一切的关键。我只需要按正确顺序输入对应的内容……",
    "There are three signals coming from the top of tower that correspond to each of the \"dreams\". You can't hear them unless you use your signalscope, but the key is that each of them matches a specific seal, as you can see here.": "塔楼顶部会发出三个信号，分别对应每个“梦境”。不用信号镜根本听不到，但关键是——如你所见，每个信号都匹配一个特定的封印。",
    "Interestingly, there are three uniquely-named signals coming from the top of the tower that correspond to each of the \"dreams\". I'm not sure how they tie-in yet, though the fact that there's only three of them makes me think they're related to the burned codes somehow.": "有意思的是，塔楼顶部会发出三个名字独特的信号，分别对应每个“梦境”。我还不清楚它们具体怎么关联，但既然刚好三个，肯定和那些烧毁的密码有关。",
    "Originally I thought that the codes were completely useless, but now I know better. They're <![CDATA[<i>]]>meant<![CDATA[</i>]]> to look that way, even though they're secretly the solution to all of this. It's practically genius when you think about it. Everyone is so fixated on the vault that they don't even think to consider that there's more to it than that. ": "一开始我以为这些密码完全没用，现在才明白过来。它们故意做成这副样子，可实际上是解开一切的关键。现在想想真的太聪明了——所有人都一门心思盯着储藏库，根本想不到背后还有别的门道。",
    "Originally I thought that the codes were completely useless, but now I know better. They're <![CDATA[<i>]]>meant<![CDATA[</i>]]> to look that way, even though they're secretly the solution to all of this. It's practically genius when you think about it. Everyone will be so fixated on the vault that they won't even think to consider that there's more to it than that. ": "一开始我以为这些密码完全没用，现在才明白过来。它们故意做成这副样子，可实际上是解开一切的关键。现在想想真的太聪明了——所有人都会一门心思盯着储藏库，根本想不到背后还有别的门道。",
    "Something to keep in mind: The signal leading to the Diving Bell is actually the master signal for this tower, rather than the other way around. That bit confused me. Other than that, the rest is pretty straight forward.": "记住一点：通往沉没的构筑物的信号，其实是这座塔楼的主信号，而不是反过来。这点我之前搞反了，有点 confusion。除此之外，剩下的就很简单了。",
    "Something to keep in mind: The signal leading to the <![CDATA[<color=orange>Submerged Structure</color>]]> is actually the master signal for this tower, rather than the other way around. That bit confused me. Other than that, the rest is pretty straight forward.": "记住一点：通往<![CDATA[<color=orange>沉没的构筑物</color>]]>的信号，其实是这座塔楼的主信号，而不是反过来。这点我之前搞反了，有点 confusion。除此之外，剩下的就很简单了。",
    "Something to keep in mind: The signal leading to the <![CDATA[<color=orange>Submerged Structure</color>]]> is actually the signal for <![CDATA[<i>]]>this<![CDATA[</i>]]> tower, rather than the other way around. That bit's confusing. Otherwise, each signal directly corresponds with each \"dream\".": "记住一点：通往<![CDATA[<color=orange>沉没的构筑物</color>]]>的信号，其实就是<![CDATA[<i>]]>这座<![CDATA[</i>]]>塔楼的信号，而不是反过来。这点有点绕。除此之外，每个信号都和对应的“梦境”直接关联。",
    "Also, I'd imagine that if you've gotten this far, and haven't heard a word from me, I didn't make it back home. Guess it is what it is, being a traveler and all. You take risks, and make peace with the consequences.": "另外，如果你能走到这里，却没听到我的任何消息，那说明我没能回家。没办法，谁让我们是探险者呢。既然选择冒险，就得接受可能的结果。",

    // Acetate_SignalBlocker（阿西泰特-信号屏蔽器）
    "Okay, so this is a bit of an interesting one. It seems that wherever this far away \"satellite\" is, it's still doing whatever it's doing, but the ability to directly control it from here is practically nonexistent.": "好吧，这玩意儿有点意思。不管那颗遥远的“卫星”在什么地方，它似乎还在正常工作，但从这里直接控制它的能力，基本上已经没有了。",
    "Of course, considering how damaged the controls are, I'm not sure they even <![CDATA[<i>]]>wanted<![CDATA[</i>]]> to control it, but that's got me thinking. Could there be another way to reestablish communication somehow? And, if so, are the means to do that locked away inside that vault?": "当然，看这些控制装置损坏的程度，我甚至怀疑他们当初就没打算长期控制它，但这让我想到——有没有别的办法重新建立通信？如果有的话，是不是藏在那个储藏库里？",
    "Of course, considering how damaged the controls are, I'm not sure they even <![CDATA[<i>]]>wanted<![CDATA[</i>]]> to control it, but that's got me thinking. Could there be another way to communicate with it somehow? And, if so, are the means to do that locked away inside that vault?": "当然，看这些控制装置损坏的程度，我甚至怀疑他们当初就没打算长期控制它，但这让我想到——有没有别的办法和它建立通信？如果有的话，是不是藏在那个储藏库里？",
    "But the only way to get inside the vault is gone, isn't it? Did they really never intend on opening it again? I find it hard to believe that a species as advanced as this would go as far as to burn the codes in the <![CDATA[<color=orange>Cinder Isles</color>]]> without leaving any other way to get inside.": "可进入储藏库的唯一途径已经没了，不是吗？他们真的打算永远不再打开它？我很难相信，这么先进的种族会烧掉<![CDATA[<color=orange>余烬群岛</color>]]>的密码，却不留下任何备用入口。",
    "I'll have to head back to the tower and have look at those codes again, but for now I'm going to focus on the vault itself. Maybe there's a non-obvious solution to opening it? I don't know. There has to be something I'm missing. Maybe I should sleep on it, see if I'm a bit more clear-headed tomorrow.": "我得回塔楼再看看那些密码，但现在先专注于储藏库本身。说不定有什么不显眼的开门方法？我不知道，但肯定有什么地方被我忽略了。或许先睡一觉，明天思路会更清晰。",
    "I'll have to head back to the tower and have look at those codes again, but for now I'm going to focus on the vault itself. Maybe there's another way to open it? I don't know. There has to be something I'm missing. Maybe I should sleep on it, see if I'm a bit more clear-headed tomorrow.": "我得回塔楼再看看那些密码，但现在先专注于储藏库本身。说不定有别的开门方法？我不知道，但肯定有什么地方被我忽略了。或许先睡一觉，明天思路会更清晰。",
    "Shame my ship is no longer in one piece. Guess my makeshift camp in the building at the <![CDATA[<color=orange>top of the dam</color>]]> will have to do for now, at least until I'm done here. You don't realize how useful actually having a ship with a bunch of stuff in it is until you don't have it anymore.": "可惜我的船已经毁了。现在只能暂时在<![CDATA[<color=orange>水坝顶部</color>]]>那栋楼里搭个临时营地，至少等我把这里的事办完。没失去之前真的想不到，一艘装满东西的船能有多实用。",
    "Shame my ship is no longer in one piece. Guess my makeshift home away from home in the building <![CDATA[<color=orange>connected to the dam</color>]]> will have to do for now, at least until I'm done here. You don't realize how useful actually having a ship with a bunch of stuff in it is until you don't have it anymore.": "可惜我的船已经毁了。现在只能暂时在<![CDATA[<color=orange>连在水坝上</color>]]>那栋楼里搭个临时的“第二个家”，至少等我把这里的事办完。没失去之前真的想不到，一艘装满东西的船能有多实用。",

    // Acetate_SecretLab（阿西泰特-秘密实验室）
    "I figured it out. It was right in front of me this whole time, and I didn't even think to look. They <![CDATA[<i>]]>really<![CDATA[</i>]]> didn't want anyone else finding out about it, did they?": "我终于弄明白了！答案一直就在我眼前，可我居然没注意到。他们<![CDATA[<i>]]>真的<![CDATA[</i>]]>一点都不想让别人发现这个秘密，是吧？",
    "Well, now all that's left is to access the <![CDATA[<color=orange>signal blocker</color>]]> again. This is big. I mean, really big. I wish Hornfels was here to see this.": "好了，现在只剩重新访问<![CDATA[<color=orange>信号屏蔽器</color>]]>了。这事儿太重大了，真的太重大了。真希望霍恩费斯能在这里亲眼看看。",

    // Acetate（阿西泰特）
    "Heyo, traveler. Long time, no see. Well, I guess it's been a long time since I've seen anyone.": "嘿，探险者。好久不见啊。好吧，其实我已经好久没见过任何人了。",
    "Acetate?": "阿西泰特？",
    "That's me. Surprised that anyone else made it here, to be honest. It's good you came, too. I was starting to get lonely. How long has it been, do you know? Does it matter?": "是我。说实话，没想到还会有人能走到这里。你能来真好，我都开始觉得孤单了。过了多久了，你知道吗？好像也不重要了。",
    "I always knew that us Hearthians would be the ones to find the Eye. Or at least I hoped so, anyhow.": "我一直知道，找到“眼”的肯定是我们哈斯人。至少我一直是这么希望的。",
    "I suppose it didn't really have to be us, if you think about it. It could have been anyone. I'm happy that it was us though, because I don't think anyone else is going to top that.": "不过仔细想想，不一定非得是我们。任何人都有可能。但我还是很高兴是我们，因为我觉得没人能超越这个成就了。",
    "The Eye of the Universe is pretty high on the list in terms of discoveries, huh? ": "“宇宙之眼”绝对能排进最伟大发现的前列，是吧？",
    "I'm pretty sure Feldspar could.": "我很确定费尔德斯巴可以。",
    "At least it wasn't the anglerfish who found it first.": "至少不是安康鱼先发现的，也算不幸中的万幸。",
    "Indeed it is. Not even the Nomai found it, and they're the <![CDATA[<i>]]>Nomai<![CDATA[</i>]]>. Kind of funny to think that we're literally the only ones here.": "那当然。连挪麦人都没找到，而他们可是<![CDATA[<i>]]>挪麦人<![CDATA[</i>]]>啊。想想这里现在真的只有我们俩，还挺有意思的。",
    "Probably. They're Feldspar, of course they could. If they didn't go missing first, I bet they would've somehow stumbled onto it completely by accident.": "说不定还真能。毕竟是费尔德斯巴嘛，肯定能。要是他没失踪，我打赌他说不定能完全靠巧合就找到这里。",
    "Oh gosh. Imagine. ": "天啊，不敢想象。",
    "I couldn't do it, you know. What's after this. I'm sure you know what I'm talking about, considering that you're here.": "我做不到，你知道吗？我没办法面对接下来的事。你能走到这里，肯定明白我在说什么。",
    "I would have eventually done it, maybe, but not now. In retrospect I'm kind of glad you showed up. Makes it so I don't have to be the one responsible for it anymore. I know that makes me sound like a coward, but this is big stuff. Arguably the biggest stuff, to put it lightly.": "或许我最终能鼓起勇气，但不是现在。现在回想起来，你能来真是太好了。这样我就不用独自承担这个责任了。我知道这听起来像个懦夫，但这事儿太重大了。说得委婉点，可能是最重大的事。",
    "I would have eventually done it, maybe, but not now. In retrospect I'm kind of glad you showed up. Makes it so I don't have to be the one responsible for it anymore. I know that makes me sound like a coward, but this is big stuff. Arguably the biggest stuff.": "或许我最终能鼓起勇气，但不是现在。现在回想起来，你能来真是太好了。这样我就不用独自承担这个责任了。我知道这听起来像个懦夫，但这事儿太重大了。可以说就是最重大的事。",
    "I guess the reason it's hard for me is that it's a bit like...<![CDATA[<Pause/>]]>confronting your own death, in a way? You stand right at the edge of the abyss and contemplate what it means to be anything. You relive your whole life in the blink of an eye, all of the good and all of the bad, and you kinda just watch it drift away until it's not there anymore. And that's it. Isn't that weird? Really when you starting thinking about this it's *all* weird, but I guess that's kind of fitting. Terrifying, but fitting.": "我想我之所以做不到，是因为这有点像……<![CDATA[<Pause/>]]>某种意义上面对自己的死亡？你站在深渊边缘，思考“存在”到底意味着什么。一瞬间重温自己的一生，所有的好与坏，然后眼睁睁看着它们慢慢消逝，直到什么都不剩。就这样而已。是不是很诡异？其实仔细想想，这一切都很诡异，但或许本该如此。恐怖，但合情合理。",
    "I guess the reason it's hard for me is that it's a bit like...<![CDATA[<Pause/>]]>confronting your own death, in a way? You stand right at the edge of the abyss and contemplate what it means to be anything. You relive your whole life in the blink of an eye, all of the good and all of the bad, and you kinda just watch it drift away until it's not there anymore. And that's it. Isn't that weird? Really when you starting thinking about this it's <![CDATA[<i>]]>all<![CDATA[</i>]]> weird, but I guess that's kind of fitting. Terrifying, but fitting.": "我想我之所以做不到，是因为这有点像……<![CDATA[<Pause/>]]>某种意义上面对自己的死亡？你站在深渊边缘，思考“存在”到底意味着什么。一瞬间重温自己的一生，所有的好与坏，然后眼睁睁看着它们慢慢消逝，直到什么都不剩。就这样而已。是不是很诡异？其实仔细想想，这<![CDATA[<i>]]>一切<![CDATA[</i>]]>都很诡异，但或许本该如此。恐怖，但合情合理。",
    "I understand why they couldn't let it go. All of this time I thought that they were evil, or cruel. But they weren't. They were terrified. One day we're given the awareness of being and then in the next it's taken away, and we don't have a choice in any of it. No one does.": "我终于明白他们为什么无法继续了。一直以来我都以为他们是邪恶或者残酷的种族，但其实不是。他们只是害怕。有一天我们被赋予了“存在”的意识，可下一秒它就可能被夺走，而我们对此毫无选择。谁都没有。",
    "Is it wrong to be afraid of that? Is it wrong for me to sit here and wonder if they're right? <![CDATA[<Pause/>]]><![CDATA[<color=grey>Sigh...</color>]]> I don't even know what I'm saying. I don't know what I want to say, really. I'm just thinking. You got stuff to do, I know, I know. But at least I appreciate you humoring me.": "害怕这些是错的吗？我坐在这里怀疑他们是不是对的，这是错的吗？<![CDATA[<Pause/>]]><![CDATA[<color=grey>叹气……</color>]]>我都不知道自己在说什么了。其实我也不知道自己想说什么，只是胡思乱想而已。我知道你还有事要做，真的知道。但还是谢谢你愿意听我唠叨。",
    "Is it wrong to be afraid of that? Is it wrong for me to sit here and wonder if they're right? <![CDATA[<Pause/>]]><![CDATA[<color=grey>Sigh...</color>]]> I don't even know what I'm saying. I don't know what I want to say, really. I'm just thinking. You got stuff to do, I know, but I appreciate you humoring me.": "害怕这些是错的吗？我坐在这里怀疑他们是不是对的，这是错的吗？<![CDATA[<Pause/>]]><![CDATA[<color=grey>叹气……</color>]]>我都不知道自己在说什么了。其实我也不知道自己想说什么，只是胡思乱想而已。我知道你还有事要做，但还是谢谢你愿意听我唠叨。",
    "I think I'm probably just going to stay here for this next part, if that's okay? Not really cut out for this sort of thing. Always been good at starting, never been great at following through. Just how I roll.": "接下来的事，我大概就留在这里了，可以吗？我真的不适合这种事。我向来擅长开始，却不擅长坚持到底。我就是这样的人。",
    "Besides, I think if you took me with you, all I'd end up doing is ruining it. This is more your jam, honestly. I'm too sentimental.": "而且，我觉得你要是带我一起去，我最后只会搞砸一切。说实话，这更适合你。我太容易感情用事了。",
    "Knock 'em dead for me, okay? You'll do great. Just try not to end up like me and miss the show, alright?": "替我好好完成这件事，好吗？你肯定能行。别像我这样，错过了最关键的时刻，好吗？",
    "I promise.": "我保证。",
    "Are you sure want me to do this?": "你真的想让我来做这件事吗？",
    "Goodbye, Acetate.": "再见，阿西泰特。",
    "Good. It's only the end of everything, after all. Give it your best shot.": "好样的。毕竟这只是一切的终结而已。全力以赴吧。",
    "No. But someone's gotta, right? Now go ahead and do it before I change my mind.": "不是想不想的问题。但总得有人去做，对吧？趁我还没改变主意，快去做吧。",
    "Goodbye, traveler. See you after the dust settles, whatever that may be.": "再见，探险者。等一切尘埃落定，我们再相见吧——不管到时候会是什么样子。",
    "What are you still standing around for? Go ahead, do it. I don't think I can wait much longer.": "你还站在这里干什么？快去啊，动手吧。我觉得我已经等不了多久了。",
    "Should I really do this?": "我真的应该这么做吗？",
    "Nevermind. I'll be going now.": "没事了。我现在就走。",
    "What's the alternative? It's not like we really have anything we can go back to. This is <![CDATA[<i>]]>it<![CDATA[</i>]]>. Just you and me, staring at the end of the everything.": "还有别的选择吗？我们已经没有可以回去的地方了。这就是<![CDATA[<i>]]>全部<![CDATA[</i>]]>了。就只有你和我，直面这一切的终结。",
    "Eternity is a long time, my friend. We can wait here all you like, but eventually it's gonna happen. One way or another.": "永恒是段漫长的时光啊，朋友。我们可以在这里一直等下去，但该发生的终究会发生。无论以哪种方式。",
    "Good. The sooner we get this over with, the better.": "好。越早结束这一切越好。",

    // Riebeck（瑞拜克）
    "I found an alien civilization hidden in our solar system!": "我在我们的星系里发现了一个隐藏的外星文明！",
    "Woah.<![CDATA[<Pause>]]> WOAH.": "哇哦。<![CDATA[<Pause>]]>哇哦？！",
    "You mean another one? Like one that wasn't the Nomai? Hidden RIGHT IN OUR SOLAR SYSTEM?!": "你是说另一个？不是挪麦人的那种？就藏在我们的星系里？！",
    "That's what I said, yes.": "对，我就是这个意思。",
    "I thought you were supposed to be an expert on these things.": "我还以为你是这方面的专家呢。",
    "Oh. Cool. <![CDATA[<Pause>]]> That's... really cool. <![CDATA[<size=20>]]>Like, really really cool.<![CDATA[</size>]]>": "哦。厉害。<![CDATA[<Pause>]]>这……这太厉害了。<![CDATA[<size=20>]]>真的，超级超级厉害。<![CDATA[</size>]]>",
    "NOT ABOUT AN ALIEN CIVILIZATION THAT NO ONE HAS EVER DISCOVERED BEFORE!": "我可不懂什么“从来没人发现过的外星文明”啊！！",
    "Okay. So you're saying that there was this whole other secret civilization that the Nomai didn't even know about? And that you discovered them all by yourself, just now, and basically came right back here to tell me about it?": "好吧。所以你的意思是，存在一个挪麦人都不知道的秘密文明？而你刚刚自己发现了他们，然后专门回到这里告诉我？",
    "Well, I'm in a time loop, so I didn't <![CDATA[<i>]]>just<![CDATA[</i>]]> come here.": "嗯，我在时间循环里，所以不是<![CDATA[<i>]]>刚刚<![CDATA[</i>]]>才来的。",
    "Actually I talked to Hornfels first, but I thought that you should know.": "其实我先跟霍恩费斯说了，但我觉得你也应该知道。",
    "Pretty much.": "差不多是这样。",
    "TIME LOOP?! WHAT TIME LOOP?! WHAT ARE YOU TALKING ABOUT?!": "<![CDATA[<size=50>]]>时间循环？！什么时间循环？！你在说什么鬼话？！<![CDATA[</size>]]>",
    "Oh great, so you find the most important discovery of our species since the Nomai, immediately go to Hornfels, come right on over to Brittle Hollow, and <![CDATA[<i>]]>then<![CDATA[</i>]]> tell me that you found an alien civilization that no one has ever discovered before? ": "哦太棒了，所以你做出了自挪麦人以来我们种族最重大的发现，先去找了霍恩费斯，然后马上飞到碎空星，<![CDATA[<i>]]>最后<![CDATA[</i>]]>才来告诉我你发现了一个没人知道的外星文明？",
    "Basically.": "差不多是这样。",
    "Wow. <![CDATA[<i>]]>Wow<![CDATA[</i>]]>. Okay. Neat. That's fine. Yes.": "哇。<![CDATA[<i>]]>哇<![CDATA[</i>]]>。好吧。厉害。行吧。嗯。",
    "Do you think that they might related to the Nomai somehow? And how could the Nomai have been here for so long and not have even known that they existed? Oh stars above, this is too much...": "你觉得他们和挪麦人会不会有什么关系？挪麦人在这里待了那么久，怎么会完全不知道他们的存在？哦我的天，这信息量太大了……",
    "So, just to make sure that I'm getting this right. There are two different species that came before us in this system. One of them was (obviously) the Nomai, who lived here thousands of years ago if not more -- and then you have this other, mystery civilization that's been here for... how long, exactly? And this is the first we're hearing about them?": "所以，我确认一下。在我们之前，这个星系里有两个不同的种族？一个（显然）是挪麦人，他们几千年前（甚至更久）就住在这里——然后还有另一个神秘文明，他们在这里待了……到底多久？而我们现在才第一次听说他们？",
    "So, just to make sure that I'm getting this right. There are two different species that came before us in this system. One of them was (obviously) the Nomai, who lived here thousands of years ago if not more - and then you have this other, mystery civilization that's been here for... how long, exactly? And this is the first we're hearing about them?": "所以，我确认一下。在我们之前，这个星系里有两个不同的种族？一个（显然）是挪麦人，他们几千年前（甚至更久）就住在这里——然后还有另一个神秘文明，他们在这里待了……到底多久？而我们现在才第一次听说他们？",
    "That's about right.": "大致是这样。",
    "Actually, three. You're forgetting about the Anglerfish, remember?": "其实是三个。你忘了安康鱼了，记得吗？",
    "Not <![CDATA[<i>]]>right<![CDATA[</i>]]> now. I'm in a time loop, remember?": "现在不是说这个的时候。我在时间循环里，记得吗？",
    "Oh gosh, don't remind me. Just thinking about Dark Bramble makes my stomach churn.": "哦天啊，别跟我提这个。一想到黑棘星我就反胃。",
    "SHUT UP ABOUT THE TIME LOOP! I don't even know what that means!": "<![CDATA[<size=50>]]>别再提时间循环了！我根本不知道那是什么意思！<![CDATA[</size>]]>",
    "But what do you think they were doing here? And where would they have come from if they're not from our solar system?! I have so many questions.": "可你觉得他们在这里做什么？如果他们不是来自我们的星系，那是从哪里来的？！我有太多问题了。",
    "But, um, wow. That's big. And I mean <![CDATA[<i>]]>really<![CDATA[</i>]]> big. Thanks, for telling me. ": "但是，嗯，哇。这太重大了。我是说<![CDATA[<i>]]>真的<![CDATA[</i>]]>太重大了。谢谢你告诉我。",
    "Are you okay?": "你还好吗？",
    "No! I mean, yes. I mean, not really. But I am! I promise! It's just... a lot, you know? ": "不好！我是说，好。我是说，其实不好。但我没事！我保证！只是……信息量太大了，你懂吗？",
    "I come out here to learn more about the Nomai and then I learn that there's this whole other species out there that we know nothing about, and suddenly the part of me that wants to know more about the Nomai also wants to know more about THAT species, and then the other part of me who still wants to know about the Nomai doesn't want to know more about that species, because they know that I'll end up spending my time trying to learn about THAT species without learning anything about the Nomai! Does that make any sense?": "我来这里是为了更多了解挪麦人，结果却发现还有一个我们完全不了解的种族。突然之间，我心里想了解挪麦人的那部分，同时也想了解那个种族；可另一部分只想了解挪麦人的我，又不想了解那个种族——因为我知道，最后我肯定会把所有时间都花在那个种族上，根本学不到任何关于挪麦人的东西！你能明白吗？",
    "Definitely.": "完全明白。",
    "What?": "什么？",
    "Can't you learn about both?": "两者不能一起了解吗？",
    "Right?!": "就是啊？！",
    "What do you mean what? I just said what! Weren't you listening?": "什么叫“什么”？我刚刚都说得很清楚了！你没在听吗？",
    "NO I CAN'T LEARN ABOUT BOTH! THAT WOULD BE IMPOSSIBLE!": "不能！我不能两者都学！那根本不可能！",
    "Anyway, it's cool that you found another species and everything, but right now I think I need to just relax, sit by this campfire, and try not to think about the fact that I could be thinking about a whole other species when I'm sitting here thinking about the Nomai. For now I think it's best that we just don't talk about it anymore. <![CDATA[<size=20>]]>For my sanity.<![CDATA[</size>]]>": "总之，你能发现另一个种族确实很厉害，但现在我只想放松一下，坐在篝火旁，专心想挪麦人的事，别去想还有另一个种族的存在。现在我觉得，我们最好别再谈论这件事了。<![CDATA[<size=20>]]>为了我的理智着想。<![CDATA[</size>]]>"
  },
  "ShipLogDictionary": {
    // Timber Hearth（木炉星）
    "Missing Explorer": "失踪的探险家",
    "Hornfels told me about a Hearthian explorer named Acetate that went missing during one of their expeditions. The last place anyone saw them was at the Lunar Outpost, on the Attlerock. I wonder if Esker knows anything.": "霍恩费斯告诉我，有个名叫阿西泰特的哈斯探险家在一次探险中失踪了。有人最后看到他的地方，是废岩星上的月球前哨站。不知道埃斯科有没有什么线索。",
    "Deep Space Satellite": "深空卫星",
    "Esker said that Acetate wanted to scout a good location for the Deep Space Satellite before starting their most recent expedition.": "埃斯科说，阿西泰特在开始最后一次探险前，想为深空卫星侦察一个合适的安装位置。",
    "According to Esker, the missing Hearthian explorer Acetate went to find an ideal orbital path for the satellite before they disappeared.": "据埃斯科说，失踪的哈斯探险家阿西泰特，在失踪前一直在为卫星寻找理想的运行轨道。",
    "According to Esker, the missing Hearthian explorer, Acetate, went to find an ideal orbital path for the satellite before they disappeared.": "据埃斯科说，失踪的哈斯探险家阿西泰特，在失踪前一直在为卫星寻找理想的运行轨道。",

    // Ring World（环形世界）
    "The Mainframe": "主机",
    "I teleported into a hidden, secret location that appears to be some sort of central control room.": "我传送到了一个隐藏的秘密地点，这里看起来像是某种中央控制室。",
    "I \"spoke\" to the column of light in the center of the room, which was last accessed relatively recently by an unspecified user. It seems to be capable of performing very limited operations, as well as providing various bits of information about the Stranger.": "我向房间中央的光柱“交谈”了。它最后一次被未知用户访问的时间不算太久远。它似乎只能执行非常有限的操作，但能提供关于“外星站”的各类信息。",
    "There are three walls which have sigils that are identical to the ones sealing the vault.": "有三面墙上的印记，和封锁储藏库的印记完全相同。",
    "I activated three \"interfaces\" which are apparently located in three different locations within the Stranger's simulated reality. I'll have to calibrate all three of them correctly in order to gain any more information from the Mainframe.": "我激活了三个“接口”，它们显然位于外星站模拟现实中的三个不同位置。要从主机获取更多信息，我必须正确校准这三个接口。",
    "After calibrating the interfaces, I was able to remotely connect to something called the Signal Capture Satellite, which is orbiting around the Stranger's term for the Eye of the Universe.": "校准接口后，我成功远程连接到了一个名为“信号捕捉卫星”的装置。它围绕着外星站所称的“宇宙之眼”运行。",
    "While it can not be turned off, the approximate location of the Signal Capture Satellite can be broadcasted to the Stranger's light spacecraft. One of the spacecraft is apparently currently in transit, but is too far away from the Stranger for its distress signal to be heard.": "虽然无法关闭信号捕捉卫星，但可以向外星站的轻型飞船广播它的大致位置。其中一艘飞船显然正在航行中，但它距离外星站太远，它的求救信号无法被接收。",
    "Remote Signal Interface 1": "远程信号接口1",
    "I activated an interface using the mainframe which is somewhere in the Shrouded Woodlands.": "我通过主机激活了一个接口，它位于覆盖林地的某个地方。",
    "Hidden Code Interface": "隐藏密码接口",
    "Acetate's log mentions that the codes found in the Cinder Isles are actually \"interfaces\", and that each interface corresponds to a major part of the Stranger's simulated reality.": "阿西泰特的记录提到，余烬群岛发现的密码其实是“接口”，每个接口都对应外星站模拟现实的一个主要区域。",
    "I inputted a keyword into the remote interface for the Shrouded Woodlands, hidden in the Forbidden Archive.": "我向藏在禁忌档案馆里的“覆盖林地远程接口”输入了关键词。",
    "Remote Signal Interface 2": "远程信号接口2",
    "I activated an interface using the mainframe which is somewhere in the Starlit Cove.": "我通过主机激活了一个接口，它位于星光海湾的某个地方。",
    "I inputted a keyword into the remote interface for the Starlit Cove, hidden in the Forbidden Archive.": "我向藏在禁忌档案馆里的“星光海湾远程接口”输入了关键词。",
    "Remote Signal Interface 3": "远程信号接口3",
    "I activated an interface using the mainframe which is somewhere in the Endless Canyon.": "我通过主机激活了一个接口，它位于无尽峡谷的某个地方。",
    "I inputted a keyword into the remote interface for the Endless Canyon, hidden in the Forbidden Archive.": "我向藏在禁忌档案馆里的“无尽峡谷远程接口”输入了关键词。",
    "Strange Visions": "诡异幻象",
    "Acetate's Investigation": "阿西泰特的调查",
    "Acetate discovered something aboard the Stranger that its inhabitants wanted to keep hidden.": "阿西泰特在外星站飞船上发现了其居民想要隐藏的秘密。",
    "Acetate was determined to find a way to open the sealed vault held in the Submerged Structure.": "阿西泰特决心找到打开沉没的构筑物中密封储藏库的方法。",
    "I saw a vision of someone walking into the water after leaving their artifact on the shoreline near the sealed vault.": "我看到一段幻象：有人把文物留在密封储藏库附近的岸边，然后走进了水里。",
    "I saw a vision of someone opening a secret passage in a cellar, and watched them walk down to the very end of a dark hallway filled with murals. ": "我看到一段幻象：有人打开了地下室的秘密通道，沿着布满壁画的黑暗走廊走到了尽头。",
    "I saw a vision of someone with an artifact opening the door to a testing room, sleeping at a green fire before awakening in front of the Mainframe.": "我看到一段幻象：有人拿着文物打开了测试室的门，在绿色火焰旁睡着，最后在主机前醒来。",
    "Acetate's Logs": "阿西泰特的记录",
    "The missing Hearthian explorer, Acetate, stumbled upon the Stranger while scouting a location for the Deep Space Satellite. They managed to get inside, but destroyed their ship in the process, and as such decided to go to the tower further down the river in order to find a more central position for their camp.": "失踪的哈斯探险家阿西泰特，在为深空卫星侦察位置时意外发现了外星站。他成功进入了外星站，但过程中毁掉了自己的船，于是决定前往河下游的塔楼，寻找更中心的营地位置。",
    "Acetate managed to miraculously recover the pilot seat from their ship, but decided that it wasn't worth the effort to haul it to their camp at the top of the dam.": "阿西泰特奇迹般地从自己的船上找回了驾驶座，但觉得没必要费力把它搬到水坝顶部的营地。",
    "Acetate managed to miraculously recover the pilot seat from their ship, but decided that it wasn't worth the effort to haul it to their shelter in the building connected to the dam.": "阿西泰特奇迹般地从自己的船上找回了驾驶座，但觉得没必要费力把它搬到水坝相连建筑里的避难所。",
    "Acetate discovered something aboard the Stranger relating to the Signal Blocker, and implied that the Stranger's inhabitants wanted to keep it hidden. ": "阿西泰特在外星站上发现了与信号屏蔽器相关的东西，并暗示外星站的居民想要隐藏它。",
    "Acetate thought that the secret to reestablishing a connection to the Signal Blocker lies inside of the sealed vault, but they were dismayed at the fact that the codes in the Cinder Isles were destroyed. They then decided to go get some rest at their \"camp\" near the top of the dam.": "阿西泰特认为，重新与信号屏蔽器建立连接的秘密藏在密封储藏库里，但余烬群岛的密码已被摧毁，这让他很沮丧。之后他决定去水坝顶部附近的“营地”休息。",
    "Acetate thought that the secret to reestablishing a connection to the Signal Blocker lies inside of the sealed vault, but they were dismayed at the fact that the codes in the Cinder Isles were destroyed. They then decided to go get some rest at their makeshift \"home\" in the building that's connected to the dam.": "阿西泰特认为，重新与信号屏蔽器建立连接的秘密藏在密封储藏库里，但余烬群岛的密码已被摧毁，这让他很沮丧。之后他决定去水坝相连建筑里的临时“家”休息。",
    "Acetate seemed to suggest that they were close to figuring out a secret about the tower in the Cinder Isles, and that they would leave a recording inside the tower's hidden code room with more information about their discovery.": "阿西泰特的记录显示，他即将解开余烬群岛塔楼的秘密，并会在塔楼的隐藏密码室留下记录，详细说明自己的发现。",
    "Acetate discovered a secret relating to the codes used to unlock the vault, and that they're tied to three frequencies emitted from the tower in the Cinder Isles.": "阿西泰特发现了打开储藏库所用密码的秘密：这些密码与余烬群岛塔楼发出的三个频率相关联。",
    "Tower Signals": "塔楼信号",
    "Island Tower Secret": "岛屿塔楼的秘密",
    "According to Acetate's log, the tower in the Cinder Isles hides a secret about the true nature of the Stranger.": "根据阿西泰特的记录，余烬群岛的塔楼隐藏着关于外星站真实本质的秘密。",
    "The tower in the Cinder Isles emits a strange, ethereal signal referred to as \"Enlightment\".": "余烬群岛的塔楼会发出一种诡异而空灵的信号，名为“启迪”。",
    "The tower in the Cinder Isles emits a technical-sounding signal referred to as \"Foresight\".": "余烬群岛的塔楼会发出一种听起来很技术化的信号，名为“远见”。",
    "The tower in the Cinder Isles emits a low, almost calming signal referred to as \"Eternity\".": "余烬群岛的塔楼会发出一种低沉、近乎令人平静的信号，名为“永恒”。",
    "The signal which leads to the Submerged Structure is actually the signal for the tower itself, while the others correspond to their respective locations.": "指向沉没的构筑物的信号，其实是塔楼本身的信号，而其他信号则对应各自的区域。",

    // Quantum Moon（量子卫星）
    "Transport Pilgrim #2": "朝圣者运输船#2",
    "Transport Pilgrim 2": "朝圣者运输船#2",
    "One of the Stranger's light spacecraft is currently in active transit to the Signal Capture Satellite.": "外星站的一艘轻型飞船目前正在前往信号捕捉卫星的途中。",
    "According to the Mainframe, the spacecraft is still broadcasting a distress signal, but the signal is too far away for the Stranger to detect it.": "主机显示，这艘飞船仍在发送求救信号，但距离外星站太远，无法被探测到。",
    "There is a light spacecraft missing from one of the Stranger's docking bays that is apparently active, but its location relative to the rest solar system is unknown.": "外星站的一个停机坪少了一艘轻型飞船，这艘飞船显然仍在运行，但它在星系中的具体位置未知。",
    "The nearest celestial body for an emergency landing based on the transport's last known location was the Wandering Moon, likely another term for the Quantum Moon.": "根据运输船最后的已知位置，最近的紧急着陆天体是“流浪卫星”，这很可能是量子卫星的另一个名称。",
    "I can only detect the distress signal while standing on the Quantum Moon's sixth location, when the moon is in orbit around the Eye of the Universe.": "只有当量子卫星位于第六个位置——也就是围绕宇宙之眼运行时，我才能探测到求救信号。"
  }
}
